## Incomplete-fix mechanism (from advisory + source diff only; no offensive PoC used)
  Commit 5f4f0fa (CVE-2026-32808 fix) added fs.is_within_directory() using os.path.commonpath()
  and wired safejoin() into SevenZip/UnRar/UnZip/HjSplit and UnTar.list()/verify() -- but LEFT
  UnTar._safe_extractall() using the STRING-level os.path.commonprefix() check:
      commonprefix(["/data/dl/pkg", "/data/dl/pkg_evil/CANARY.txt"]) == "/data/dl/pkg"  -> PASSES (bug)
      commonpath  (["/data/dl/pkg", "/data/dl/pkg_evil/CANARY.txt"]) == "/data/dl"      -> FAILS  (fix)
  A tar member "../pkg_evil/CANARY.txt" therefore escapes to a SIBLING dir sharing a string prefix
  with the extraction dir. CVE-2026-35592 fix (commit 0fc250c9) switches to is_within_directory/commonpath.

